|YKOOnce the farm feels easy, pick a guild -- it defines your abilities
for the climb ahead. Browse the roster, the playstyle archetypes, and
which pairings work before committing.

Level at the adventurers guild with |YKBadvance|YKO; experience costs
grow with each level, and your stats shape what your abilities can do.

You can handle normal advancement from anywhere. |YKBremcost|YKO is a safe,
read-only report of stat costs, available raises, caps, and experience needed.
Use |YKBremadvance <stat>|YKO to raise one stat or
|YKBremadvance level|YKO to buy every level you can currently afford.
Guild advancement still happens at your guild hall with
|YKBadvance guild|YKO. Despite their names, the rem commands work before
remort.

Non-remort players may use |YKBset autolevel on|YKO to spend experience on
levels automatically; leave it off when you want to bank experience for
stat raises. Remort souls always level automatically.|XX0

